    "original_gold_lex_dicts": {
        "Id1": {
            "text": "Agremia\u00e7\u00e3o Sportiva Arapiraquense has 17000 members and has the nickname Asa Gigante. They play in the Campeonato Brasileiro S\u00e9rie C league from Brazil, whose champions are Vila Nova Futebol Clube. The Est\u00e1dio Municipal Coaracy da Mata Fonseca is the name of the ground of Agremia\u00e7\u00e3o Sportiva Arapiraquense and is located in Arapiraca."
        },
        "Id2": {
            "text": "Agremiacao Sportiva Arapiraquense's (nicknamed Asa Gigante) ground is the Estadio Municipal Coaracy da Mata Fonseca (located in Arapiraca) & has 17000 members. Agremia\u00e7\u00e3o Sportiva Arapiraquense play in the Campeonato Brasileiro S\u00e9rie C league, but Vila Nova Futebol Clube in Brazil are the champions of Campeonato Brasileiro Serie C."
        },
        "Id3": {
            "text": "Asa Gigante is the nickname of the Agremia\u00e7\u00e3o Sportiva Arapiraquense, which has 17000 members. They play in the Campeonato Brasileiro S\u00e9rie C league from Brazil where Vila Nova Futebol Clube have been champions. The Est\u00e1dio Municipal Coaracy da Mata Fonseca is the name of the ground of Agremia\u00e7\u00e3o Sportiva Arapiraquense and it is located in Arapiraca."
